Package: gogopi-services
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Albert den Haan <albert.denhaan@gmail.com>
Depends: @PYTHON_DEP@, hostapd, dnsmasq, iw, haveged
Description: GoGoPi robot systemd services (developed for a Raspberry Pi 4)
 Button scan (WiFi reset / safe shutdown), WiFi manager and boot-time sonar
 nav lights for the GoGoPi robot platform: a Hiwonder expansion board on a
 Raspberry Pi 4 running Ubuntu 24.04 (arm64).
 .
 The services run from a Python venv bundled under /opt/gogopi, built on the
 robot, so the package is tied to arm64 and to the Python minor version it
 was built with.
